      "translation": "Startoptionen für dieses Spiel"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: apps/NeuRoticHub/ui/GameSettingsView.h",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The existing profile is preserved. Resolve duplicate or invalid Object Rules entries in OptiScaler.ini before editing.",
      "id": "desktop.gamesettingsview.the_existing_profile_is_preserved_resolve_duplic_feed7f2c",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [
        "OptiScaler.ini"
      ],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "gamesettingsview",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "translation": "Das bestehende Profil bleibt erhalten. Beheben Sie doppelte oder ungültige Einträge in Object Rules in OptiScaler.ini vor der Bearbeitung."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: apps/NeuRoticHub/ui/GameSettingsView.h",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The game loader reads AFModifyComparison while its saver writes ModifyComparison. Both existing keys remain preserved until this mismatch is resolved.",
      "id": "desktop.gamesettingsview.the_game_loader_reads_afmodifycomparison_while_i_c363b7b2",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "gamesettingsview",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "translation": "Der Spiele-Loader liest AFModifyComparison, während der Saver ModifyComparison schreibt. Beide bestehenden Schlüssel bleiben erhalten, bis diese Unstimmigkeit behoben ist."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: apps/NeuRoticHub/ui/GameSettingsView.h",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The game loader reads AFModifyMinMax while its saver writes ModifyMinMax. Both existing keys remain preserved until this mismatch is resolved.",
      "id": "desktop.gamesettingsview.the_game_loader_reads_afmodifyminmax_while_its_s_7d42b506",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "gamesettingsview",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "translation": "Der Spiele-Loader liest AFModifyMinMax, während der Saver ModifyMinMax schreibt. Beide bestehenden Schlüssel bleiben erhalten, bis diese Unstimmigkeit behoben ist."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: apps/NeuRoticHub/ui/GameSettingsView.h",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The in-game control is unbounded. No validated portable provider range is defined, so its saved value remains preserved.",
      "id": "desktop.gamesettingsview.the_in_game_control_is_unbounded_no_validated_po_8664cbde",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "gamesettingsview",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "translation": "Die Steuerung im Spiel ist unbegrenzt. Es ist kein validierter portabler Providerbereich definiert, daher bleibt der gespeicherte Wert erhalten."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: apps/NeuRoticHub/ui/GameSettingsView.h",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The valid rectangle depends on the game's current frame dimensions and active frame-generation provider.",
      "id": "desktop.gamesettingsview.the_valid_rectangle_depends_on_the_game_s_curren_30f2fc17",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "gamesettingsview",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "translation": "Das gültige Rechteck hängt von den aktuellen Frame-Abmessungen des Spiels und dem aktiven Frame-Generation-Provider ab."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: apps/NeuRoticHub/ui/GameSettingsView.h",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "This entry is preserved: duplicate keys/sections or a value that cannot be safely edited here. Check OptiScaler.ini before editing this setting.",
      "id": "desktop.gamesettingsview.this_entry_is_preserved_duplicate_keys_sections__376ab0f6",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [
        "OptiScaler.ini"
      ],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "gamesettingsview",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "translation": "Dieser Eintrag bleibt erhalten: doppelte Schlüssel/Abschnitte oder ein Wert, der hier nicht sicher bearbeitet werden kann. Überprüfen Sie die OptiScaler.ini vor dem Bearbeiten dieser Einstellung."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: apps/NeuRoticHub/ui/GameSettingsView.h",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "This saved profile is used only when Advanced Multipass includes this pass. Automatic values inherit the preceding pass when the game loads them.",
      "id": "desktop.gamesettingsview.this_saved_profile_is_used_only_when_advanced_mu_b8c1ac32",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "gamesettingsview",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "translation": "Dieses gespeicherte Profil wird nur verwendet, wenn Erweitertes Multipass diesen Pass enthält. Automatische Werte erben den vorhergehenden Pass, wenn das Spiel sie lädt."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: apps/NeuRoticHub/ui/GameSettingsView.h",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "This value divides active game depth. The in-game input is unbounded; a safe range cannot be inferred without its depth format.",
      "id": "desktop.gamesettingsview.this_value_divides_active_game_depth_the_in_game_43991363",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "gamesettingsview",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "translation": "Dieser Wert teilt die aktive Spieltiefe. Die Eingabe im Spiel ist unbegrenzt; ein sicherer Bereich kann ohne das Tiefenformat nicht abgeleitet werden."
    },
