      "translation": "Gespeicherte Preset-Anforderung. Die installierte DLSS- oder Ray-Reconstruction-DLL bestimmt unterstützte Presets; Automatisch behält bestehenden Standard/globale Vererbung bei."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: tools/packaging/customer/support/NeuRotic-HubSettings.ps1",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Saved request only. Zero disables the override. Ratios depend on the running game, graphics card and provider qualification.",
      "id": "desktop.neurotic-hubsettings.saved_request_only_zero_disables_the_override_ra_a66f0429",
      "line_breaks": true,
