      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Das Modell anwenden"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "as a point. For the first point use the Paper white slider above; for",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.as_a_point_for_the_first_point_use_the_paper_whi_d5ff1019",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "als einen Punkt. Für den ersten Punkt verwenden Sie den Schieberegler Papierweiß oben; für"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "At 1 the whole frame is there at its right proportions, with bars above",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.at_1_the_whole_frame_is_there_at_its_right_propo_e29b0661",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Bei 1 ist der gesamte Frame in seinen richtigen Proportionen vorhanden, mit Balken oben"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "At strength zero the frame is still bit-identical whatever this says.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.at_strength_zero_the_frame_is_still_bit_identica_4926015d",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Bei Stärke Null ist der Frame immer noch bitidentisch, egal was hier steht."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "status",
      "english": "Attempts %llu | fallback streak %llu | last fallback attempt %llu",
