      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "abdriften und den Vergleich verfälschen."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Each coloured segment represents one pass. Cumulative totals fill passes from left to right.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.each_coloured_segment_represents_one_pass_cumula_e3376b66",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Jedes farbige Segment repräsentiert einen Durchlauf. Kumulierte Summen füllen Durchläufe von links nach rechts."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "edited on the right. Both halves are squeezed horizontally to fit, so it is",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.edited_on_the_right_both_halves_are_squeezed_hor_d175275b",
      "line_breaks": false,
