    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "even-handed about left and right, and a difference can read as an",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.even_handed_about_left_and_right_and_a_differenc_11019a25",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "ausgewogen zwischen links und rechts, und eine Differenz kann als"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "every point after, move to different light and use the Trim, which the",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.every_point_after_move_to_different_light_and_us_15d3440e",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "jeden Punkt danach, bewegen Sie sich in anderes Licht und verwenden Sie den Trim, der"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "everything above (Detail/Colour strength, highlight guard, palette). It wins in",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.everything_above_detail_colour_strength_highligh_f2c400a2",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "alles oben (Detail-/Farbstärke, Highlight-Guard, Palette). Es gewinnt in"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "exactly, and that is the right answer here.",
