      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Die gemessene native Kadenz erreichte das Ziel bei der ausgewählten Auflösungspräferenz. Ungetestete Routen sind ungemessen."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "The model was trained on finished frames where white sits at 1. The",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_model_was_trained_on_finished_frames_where_w_459eba8c",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Das Modell wurde auf fertigen Frames trainiert, in denen Weiß bei 1 liegt. Die"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The most the pass may move any pixel, as a multiple of what it already was, in",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_most_the_pass_may_move_any_pixel_as_a_multip_a98a4d7e",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Das Maximum, das der Durchlauf ein Pixel verschieben darf, als Vielfaches seines bisherigen Wertes, in"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "tooltip",
      "english": "The most the pass may move any pixel, as a multiple of what it already was, in\nboth directions -- a pixel may not be brightened past this nor darkened past\nits reciprocal. Lights are where the model has least to say and rescaling its\nanswer does the most damage; 2x leaves detail intact while stopping a strip\nlight turning into a string of coloured cells. Raise it only if bright areas\nlook clipped.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_most_the_pass_may_move_any_pixel_as_a_multip_dc109d72",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Das Maximum, das der Durchlauf ein Pixel verschieben darf, als Vielfaches seines bisherigen Wertes, in\nbeide Richtungen -- ein Pixel darf nicht darüber hinaus aufgehellt oder unter seinen\nKehrwert abgedunkelt werden. Lichter sind Bereiche, in denen das Modell am wenigsten zu sagen hat und eine Neuskalierung seiner\nAntwort den größten Schaden anrichtet; 2x lässt Details intakt, während verhindert wird, dass eine\nLichtleiste zu einer Kette farbiger Zellen wird. Erhöhen Sie es nur, wenn helle Bereiche\nabgeschnitten wirken."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "checkbox",
      "english": "The number runs the other way",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_number_runs_the_other_way_f51dcad9",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Die Zahl verläuft in die andere Richtung"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The original image was preserved. Review the route reasons below and try another scene.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_original_image_was_preserved_review_the_rout_fef0975a",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Das Originalbild blieb erhalten. Überprüfen Sie unten die Routengründe und versuchen Sie eine andere Szene."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The pass chain becomes active when DLSS Neural Rendering is enabled and ready.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_pass_chain_becomes_active_when_dlss_neural_r_5f6c65d3",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [
        "DLSS"
      ],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Die Pass-Kette wird aktiv, wenn DLSS Neural Rendering aktiviert und bereit ist."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "the scan instead.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_scan_instead_d5975197",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "stattdessen den Scan."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "(the scan is only watching -- the white point above comes",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_scan_is_only_watching_the_white_point_above__316e762e",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "(der Scan schaut nur zu -- der Weißpunkt oben kommt"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "(the scan is only watching -- the white point above comes from somewhere else)",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_scan_is_only_watching_the_white_point_above__32fa3a87",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "(der Scan schaut nur zu -- der Weißpunkt oben kommt von woanders her)"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "the scene brightens; some store its reciprocal, and a buffer",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_scene_brightens_some_store_its_reciprocal_an_a93eb850",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "die Szene wird heller; einige speichern ihren Kehrwert, und ein Puffer"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The selected route is below the native target. Compare the measured alternatives; untested routes are unmeasured.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_selected_route_is_below_the_native_target_co_36091308",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Die gewählte Route liegt unter dem nativen Ziel. Vergleichen Sie die gemessenen Alternativen; ungetestete Routen sind ungemessen."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "the shared value and rebuilds changed models; disabling Multipass restores the",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_shared_value_and_rebuilds_changed_models_dis_a6df80bb",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "den gemeinsamen Wert und baut geänderte Modelle neu auf; die Deaktivierung von Multipass stellt die"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "The table is per game and shareable: one person calibrates a game",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_table_is_per_game_and_shareable_one_person_c_a8914125",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Die Tabelle ist pro Spiel und teilbar: eine Person kalibriert ein Spiel"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "(the upscaler is not re-run on a held frame), and the game's own HUD and",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_upscaler_is_not_re_run_on_a_held_frame_and_t_e107d2d0",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "(der Upscaler wird bei einem gehaltenen Frame nicht erneut ausgeführt) und das eigene HUD des Spiels und"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "the upscaler. The best source there is, because it is decided",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_upscaler_the_best_source_there_is_because_it_11f8fdd5",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "den Upscaler. Die beste Quelle, die es gibt, da sie bestimmt wird"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "tooltip",
      "english": "The white point for the selected calibration point, or -- with no row\nselected -- the value the next Anchor press captures.\n\nSet it until the picture looks right here, then Anchor. Move to very\ndifferent light and do it again: two points fix the buffer's real\nrelationship and the white point holds between them. Click a row below\nto come back and adjust that point; click it again to let go.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_white_point_for_the_selected_calibration_poi_8d3b3156",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Der Weißpunkt für den gewählten Kalibrierungspunkt oder -- wenn keine Zeile\nausgewählt ist -- der Wert, den der nächste Anker-Druck erfasst.\n\nStellen Sie es ein, bis das Bild hier richtig aussieht, dann Anker. Gehen Sie in sehr\nanderes Licht und wiederholen Sie es: Zwei Punkte fixieren die tatsächliche\nBeziehung des Puffers und der Weißpunkt hält dazwischen. Klicken Sie auf eine Zeile unten,\num zurückzukehren und diesen Punkt anzupassen; klicken Sie erneut, um loszulassen."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "The white point for the selected calibration point, or -- with no row",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_white_point_for_the_selected_calibration_poi_f6462b84",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Der Weißpunkt für den gewählten Kalibrierungspunkt oder -- wenn keine Zeile"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Their settings can be edited in Neural Rendering Multipass before enabling it.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.their_settings_can_be_edited_in_neural_rendering_abfc2e07",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Ihre Einstellungen können in Neural Rendering Multipass vor der Aktivierung bearbeitet werden."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "their shipped defaults. Baseline Pass 1 and the shared pass count above remain unchanged.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.their_shipped_defaults_baseline_pass_1_and_the_s_8ec3adde",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "ihre Auslieferungsstandards zurück. Basis-Durchlauf 1 und die gemeinsame Pass-Anzahl oben bleiben unverändert."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "thing that came from the small raster is the edit itself.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.thing_that_came_from_the_small_raster_is_the_edi_36d0e928",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Ding, das aus dem kleinen Raster kam, ist die Bearbeitung selbst."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "warning",
      "english": "This game supplies an exposure -- the option above would use it.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.this_game_supplies_an_exposure_the_option_above__670fc5b1",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Dieses Spiel liefert eine Belichtung -- die obige Option würde sie verwenden."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "This game supplies no exposure -- paper white is in use. Try",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.this_game_supplies_no_exposure_paper_white_is_in_0c2e90b6",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Dieses Spiel liefert keine Belichtung -- Papierweiß wird verwendet. Versuchen Sie"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "warning",
      "english": "This game supplies no exposure -- paper white is in use. Try the scan instead.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.this_game_supplies_no_exposure_paper_white_is_in_f21bc91d",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Dieses Spiel liefert keine Belichtung -- Papierweiß wird verwendet. Versuchen Sie stattdessen den Scan."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "This is not a fudge factor. If a game needs the trim far from 1 to look",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.this_is_not_a_fudge_factor_if_a_game_needs_the_t_a3f41f06",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Dies ist kein Schummelfaktor. Wenn ein Spiel den Trim weit entfernt von 1 braucht, um gut auszusehen,"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "This was once a multiplier on a measured white point. The measurement is",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.this_was_once_a_multiplier_on_a_measured_white_p_6aa78244",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
