    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Controls apply to the active replacement backend. Provider activity does not establish displayed frame delivery.",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.controls_apply_to_the_active_replacement_backend_e7fdb9ac",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Steuerungen gelten für das aktive Ersatz-Backend. Provider-Aktivität bewirkt keine Anzeige-Frame-Bereitstellung."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Controls how strongly sharpening is reduced across depth edges.\n\nHigher values more aggressively prevent sharpening across object boundaries (reduces halos).\nLower values allow more sharpening to pass across edges (sharper but riskier).",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.controls_how_strongly_sharpening_is_reduced_acro_49743ae3",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Steuert, wie stark die Schärfung über Tiefenkanten hinweg reduziert wird.\n\nHöhere Werte verhindern aggressiver die Schärfung über Objektgrenzen hinweg (reduziert Halos).\nNiedrigere Werte lassen mehr Schärfung über Kanten hinweg zu (schärfer, aber riskanter)."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Controls how strongly sharpening is reduced across depth edges.",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.controls_how_strongly_sharpening_is_reduced_acro_965fed7b",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Steuert, wie stark die Schärfung über Tiefenkanten hinweg reduziert wird."
    },
    {
