      "translation": "Hilft Spielen, die für einiges schwarze Ränder verwenden"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Higher ratio rejected; save and restart to retry. NR Reset cannot clear it. Game, Off and 2X remain available.",
